{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30010_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:33c3c9ba3f1692deb0f38c03a7dc7ac6657ae5140470697f0b0ba0f6fbe391e1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:277d224fc2d1a8b2fd845ae9a31408988fee3eced58e2481bb119541c2ace745",
      "text": "随时间流逝，亦入心田",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d65c4cf09f88a713199444479f98e76fe13b244c4106dbc9273502accefa285a",
      "text": "雨彦在自家大扫除时，找到了父亲留给自己的\n手表。那是一直被收存起来的旧物，\n但通过工作获得意料之外的重逢后，\n雨彦的心境也悄然迎来了变化。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:277d224fc2d1a8b2fd845ae9a31408988fee3eced58e2481bb119541c2ace745",
      "text": "随时间流逝，亦入心田",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_a:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d9e83aa9ceff81365aca00b13170561c0d97784446ecb5712811a8202db0036",
      "text": "雨彦的自家房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:feba141ebc51482b60d2eedd22ef31ea7b980b1a852224fbb35950248dc64ad5",
      "text": "……架子上的整理，差不多就这样了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef90ac902f41a1c389704805d39ed70abcd222a1a41c416584701b74b1f3b926",
      "text": "（进入315 Pro以后，工作的文件和其他杂物\n越来越多了。我记得，这边好像也收着不少东西……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07bfb1fe04649a84aa03c73f96c15ab29dbe1e0b89b42572dfbb0622263aff46",
      "text": "这是老爹的手表……\n居然翻出了一件挺让人怀念的旧物啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f0675007980699513656ed1f3a7f03146e8e17ac2ab06fc58ff4f26321f38e3",
      "text": "（说起来，这是我离开家来东京的时候带过来的。\n不过一直没有戴它的心思，就一直放着……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0a9bb718c9e426f719da187b0472ef4042aface92eeb360e268e389846aadf0",
      "text": "（……作为遗物收下以来，就从没有打理过啊。\n坏了也是理所当然的吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_a:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cae2fad202bd436f3061d2b436b626a99307e13da93c685713b48a4d96d5db5",
      "text": "……能像这样找出来，也算是一种缘分吧。\n改天拿去送修好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_b:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_b:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b83027b478420ddbdd018c9e59f64ee9be44a33cf0f2dadc9c3e274fb9aec91",
      "text": "业务商谈现场·会议室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6672cd44b3f49162c6c26bce495a6e8de2ccd51fe22c052df83320ac8bdcf4cb",
      "text": "（老字号钟表品牌KIETOKI，\n给Legenders发来了工作邀约）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7aec4833a158e0b7c5a8537e7302f6d20d82db92ac79de973e3d2382fd6fb90a",
      "text": "（作为公关担当，担任手表模特、出演广告、\n歌曲商业合作……要做的事非常丰富！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b10e010e6beb4753169d1c9af5cff384a99630a4cc035b31d24bafb644ae6447",
      "text": "……以上就是全部说明。\n各位有什么疑问吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f186e46cbdbf72efed0cca259a93371b4a69254fb6f00946126ade81f4600839",
      "text": "我在意的地方刚才●●●●プロデューサー\n都已经帮忙问过了，我没问题哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5d96788f7dcf6cc6e3f95e44af93257ddd4f75c78f940c158fa39f32b6bb5fb",
      "text": "我也没有问题。能把这么重要的工作\n托付给我们这群新人，实在是非常荣幸。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f1799b104f369abf20635ffd2374b9417b3b41542eb875039cca8c42525d982",
      "text": "确实如此。\n为了不辜负期望，我等定当竭力精进。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ed989a926cd24b1f1c10fda994777efeaeab8f23da619256f7d514176e82392",
      "text": "哪里的话，各位能够接下这份工作我们也感到十分高兴！\n在活动当天到来前，还请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e8ba9664e3495189aeb26b864b95ef25e22916ec7f47f9d568d25d7aa7dd596",
      "text": "那么，今天的商谈就到此结束。\n下周初我们会再次联系……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_b:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e755c96eef0ff5e963d3fcbd69263e3fd94679e7a479ddf5c4141d956b779410",
      "text": "打扰一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_b:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:376f636e08f0cc837e40c094e3b4fff729dec486bc29340f5849eb6083333bc4",
      "text": "木时会长！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff81a3fb529c242472c324b99639f3eb40c25b3902113ab1ae56494085592935",
      "text": "（会长？那就是很有地位的人了呢～\n挑这个节骨眼来，是有什么事呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c911d4e3b63d413314c788626ca65186e6164a7b807baa2a290260000b7759db",
      "text": "惊扰到各位很抱歉。\n商谈还在进行中吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b971cc3461e6b102efc69acc9a6e097b6a34fc6944fd897476bd26031f7b5677",
      "text": "不，刚才刚刚结束。\n会长，请问有什么吩咐吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ef89b941059bbbc66fec61ba1730c2b3daa4b4ac7a29302f334e3fb1aa2f6be",
      "text": "唔，没有，我只是想来看看这次委托合作的，\nLegenders的葛之叶君到底是……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bc2adecede7df5b136f520e2cd772bf19fa83b2af2a786523e547b20d3391d6",
      "text": "啊啊，果然没错啊。看了你的相貌就认出来了。\n我是为了找你聊聊，才顺道过来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15f5b47446918c9de36e8168fc768644d753b2d60dc787d4d1f4111cd63b2c10",
      "text": "（找我有事……？我对这位长辈可没有印象啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_c:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae70893276969d48339903a5d1ac20e0b435573b21423018956015fdad7f98aa",
      "text": "等会儿能占用你一点时间吗。当然，\n前提是必须得到你的制作人的允许才行……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b20ce01dab40548aaef4909dcff62983458a49e0207941c25a99cc6ab509d9c4",
      "text": "Legenders之后的行程是空着的，\n我这边完全没有问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_c:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffaf6efff9222458bc14e60e7d46432f7266dd1c4bd503ab2b790380ee7cbf45",
      "text": "雨彦先生，您的意下如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1d939eb394f621cf8a40272995c6236bee7d6bd12aa4086cdd81bf089763e11",
      "text": "啊啊，我也没问题。等结束了我再联络。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_c:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cce0027d20d478d94f535d27bd7be9b7ecb363ecbbd0ee3dac6029375cefe99f",
      "text": "那么，就由我来送各位离开吧。\n会长，失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_c:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c32bdc2cf4b3fa5c77753f080d5495b883f050782694d95612a6ee19d221acb3",
      "text": "（特意找我搭话，难道说是\n要给妖怪清洁社委托清扫工作？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_c:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47dc07d8f45933e2bfba4f0ce14b19a145728e5968e8b7b915a66f5a4e5ae617",
      "text": "（不过，这家公司的氛围相当干净。\n并没有感觉到有什么需要我们家插手的地方啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec8a793cc53249413af836e7a90011f9cf9e1e2c14cf08b97715172a6fbb0da1",
      "text": "突然把你留下来真是不好意思。吓了一跳吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7025206603926aaeb814572176a56bee6779b6c20d39e18800a967e33e88264e",
      "text": "在正式交谈之前，能容我冒昧问一句吗。\n我们之前，曾在哪里见过面吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cca3fef650f0a1c0bbf42632a8faa44b797b04c3068f10d6209d081ae377986",
      "text": "没有没有，和你这是头一回见面。\n不过，我以前见过你的父亲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:945be6d8a968a9dce08de9b624c8916512d13c4822c7141b23c850e62d3b22c7",
      "text": "……我父亲？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ac0769a1826cdc1ced21e4850f5c576b9235956fb13a8948437c23683e2cecc",
      "text": "（真没想到。老爹居然还认识这样的人物，\n以前连听都没……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ffa229ab80ba2b8c7a6bdabfdb29a766629381bdd10dc7cd59480885f6e1a74",
      "text": "（……不。我们因为工作的特殊性，\n哪怕是对家里人也隐藏着许多秘密）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db09701e749006c4f1adb10f90f008befe0dd2a42e10772e69a8bc276a6a23b3",
      "text": "（有时是委托人要求“切勿外传”，\n有时是自己决定不对外透露所见的事物）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64d08cc1d7c29cf5b63e4d45df9ab3e3a16c1e75d903efc5ebea1996e947da37",
      "text": "（老爹身上我不了解的侧面，多得数不胜数吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c91893430611330f8fb452104e8a4e892792ef2257d5850974da057c7ddd0429",
      "text": "KIETOKI以前是在奈良起步的。\n在它还被叫做木时钟表店这样一家小公司的时候……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6581e5c94a73684ab0c89927badd0881309e9ab458d418e6853d2b56df9da48",
      "text": "我们总是委托妖怪清洁社来做打扫。\n当时负责我们店的，就是你的父亲啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_d:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e709e325b2ebe4884e588bb017a283bf7430120514ae4e38c224354260a56fc1",
      "text": "原来如此，曾有过这样一段交情啊。\n这么说父亲他，连有个儿子的事也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69a8dbccdc166e0fe8daafde6f198b829407fce01924e461232ac286371f5125",
      "text": "啊啊，听说过。所以从秘书手里拿到文件、\n看到“葛之叶”这个姓氏的时候我吃了一惊啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d547a296f0f759bb3fc80ee303ceb4770d52911aefe594ffa0e1aa07e9131a9",
      "text": "心想莫非是他的儿子？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:453cd6e59f487c4ecd3c4e7653542ddfdd32b4e9ae17b1a0cc91bebc5df4bd32",
      "text": "哎呀……这可真是一段奇妙的机缘巧合啊。\n能拿下这份工作的，幸好是我们Legenders。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:260effe2dd32aeb09a3c381704dfcd0d76f20c619a0912b08c1c371abf0408e7",
      "text": "当年家父受您关照了。\n不知那时我们家的工作做得如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9287ed6bf04704afe8f0417998727c2408534407bc2b6eda09a99eafec19185e",
      "text": "太出色了。只要经过他打扫，\n不可思议地，连公司里的氛围都会变好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ad5a79f0e1218161d15c47f5bbf651007c78b0f312c6a907f50d02305f23d9e",
      "text": "自从总公司迁到东京之后就再没见过了，\n令尊身体还硬朗吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee020a693556239017a668976d65016fbdd92315ca43154c5de236da698c6c94",
      "text": "家父他……已经过世了。\n那是大约5年前的事了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcc8872a5f439cd2bea1b08f41c049fe64a76b567f234acaa4c6ddc94ddb371f",
      "text": "……这样啊。那可真是太遗憾了。\n他明明比我还要年轻啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4827be9d4b07c03c7a337d3f89be0270aa116aef087a8aaeb35a38623ebc6271",
      "text": "我以前曾送过他一块手表。\n本想着问问他用得顺不顺手呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9636bff1cdddc400b1605a385c051a27e7e5cbce138d79e4d6b0c0d2a3eb6351",
      "text": "（手表？难不成，就是前阵子翻出来的那块……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45759434b6aaefd51ee6a21aba069591c27d1414e5fa296bef3c349c63204488",
      "text": "那块手表，我现在继承下来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17a465fc9fc06ba6340e28e7245112118c37245011d8880afcc51b2bb239330a",
      "text": "不过由于我平日疏于照管，表已经停走了。\n正想着过几天拿去送修……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a33bea3b76771669359a602c29e739f57c61b8f8e336b624b420fb3c23ebc86",
      "text": "原来是这样吗！它还能留存至今真是太好了。\n如果你不介意的话，交由我来为你修理如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdd913a552c9b2afd9e9e35007ce24930290db66f5c20e473c3e15f05224d4d7",
      "text": "能承蒙此意实在是不胜感激，不过真的可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:712c3f9256cad1810f569a4cfa54d763104e0aff979c6d4b271ccf94043f14d3",
      "text": "当然。别看我这样，我以前也是技工出身。\n即便是现在，我自己的表也都是自己亲手修理的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0278ebeebadeb4c66ee0fadee19c95562f2f2f0a65f4d4c15bbc78f131f1dc2",
      "text": "那么，就拜托您了。\n如果是由您来修理，家父泉下有知也一定会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000068:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adccf2e7a9d6877929d428cd50978c115e1c86ba75b63f3fad0ebed9ebade248",
      "text": "事务所·休息室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000076:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:999c2c114746f0cd147018ab15cbe4c0f4e110df3e8426715b616d1cb812c084",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n我和会长谈完了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000078:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aeabe1481bc7056cdc39fec1d761f143897b29d84d7e4e0e6c0ffc4651dc6f4",
      "text": "本来也想向你简单说明一下谈话的内容，\n不过在电话里，稍微有点不太好解释呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000080:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6514815566c7b6f220c75082da6f1834058f139640ad0faa7e61bd1b85eee982",
      "text": "现在能见个面吗？想当面和你聊聊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000082:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9398b402448d7fb958fab95eaa3f61d8585b7a41f2700876e636bc2e0514b924",
      "text": "没问题的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000085:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df06640afb462e966d74c044fe89af6a0baee19a2a1dc087cdde51c6dbc3b4f4",
      "text": "那可太好了。\n我大概一个小时左右到事务所，到时候拜托啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000087:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ddce775bde51ccc5bda4f0492aa9cd3021e7f2a77e802a7de3c9da83e1f6325",
      "text": "嗯？不对，约在事务所可以吗？\n你现在人在哪里？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000089:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f336e9413c9001b6ad942453be82310c44ac52d290e6d14edeb7ce16af72ee66",
      "text": "我和想乐先生以及克里斯先生\n都在事务所里",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000092:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46787a72f480937c6e7d8e0439e4d813a74beae819467988acb92b07b442e94a",
      "text": "他们两个也在？我还以为，\n那俩家伙早就回去了呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_e:cmd-000094:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d71f6db4502d0e66828351b1422e41698c33318bae9a44d0fc5749107ebb1a8d",
      "text": "算了，等会儿再聊吧。回见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_f:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16216436c5b82da4dd0de41754414e2d7a9993afd63ae3cac590ed427f10856e",
      "text": "一小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_f:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:962ef959efb078b87cf695ffb78320326c4cf88c9590ed4bda4d9e5fe5778eb0",
      "text": "竟然有这种事。雨彦的父亲，居然与会长是故交。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c975f68cb7f5803777bde5f20a6dfd5f0067c6a1637e8e93d17482264706965",
      "text": "是啊，我也吃了一惊。……说起来，\n北村和古论，怎么都还留在这里？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2b4d74ea11d84148b1ba7f126d5f8978466fbf4d004e33182f83a89e0da358c",
      "text": "你们两个，可不像是会担心我\n而特意留下来干等的性格吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:391fa89864b8ff205cb34468ff804c144863ab92ed767692eac24206f3a852ec",
      "text": "实际上，和雨彦先生分开之后，\n发生了这样的一件事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edc5522b3c45b15fac5945c65312adb73f02e799da6908ac0250699e326fb957",
      "text": "太好了，这间会议室刚好空着。\n那我们就立刻继续刚才的话题吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_f:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0191adbf53d1f1dc4cebdbded8a687ac2e67f2e036e36a4d5a991c9ea8df541",
      "text": "您说的话题，是指刚才我随口提到的、\n关于这次作为公关手表的印象那些吗～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60b2ae3fddcfb8ab87c2d61df51549e78789c192ca7ba3e1eb92ebfe8fc48ee7",
      "text": "是的。本来是打算送各位下楼的，真是不好意思。\n但是，能请您再跟我们详细讲讲吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_f:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9eba87cd60dcf50e9a2dda51dac49dd6e3a6b7bd2712dac9502a89ee0b995e63",
      "text": "就算您这么说，我也只是觉得，\n这个设计有哪里不错啦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_f:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f92ae7925ee6c9b1c2afa19abfdd0b5ee72cdfa1d916e56104a82a9ed86df73c",
      "text": "或者是感觉会有什么样的人愿意买它之类的，\n稍微泛泛地聊了几句而已哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_f:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cbe8d335173c1098f2a81f4a6343b9c9fce8c60f0561d22f8a454f760dce85b",
      "text": "我觉得那些见解非常切中要害。\n请务必让我们拿来作为这次公关的参考！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_f:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e307a88959ee41cf54e15a7769c057b8aa35f623d1481e8913d8f032c0962fe6",
      "text": "（这负责人没问题吧～\n居然这么想听门外汉的意见……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_f:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6986962636df05024ddaf5754384a7d550504c2e3803cabb93a7da52bae392e1",
      "text": "负责人先生所言极是！\n我也一直觉得，想乐的观察力非常出色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_f:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfb8bdd6fde4ae3b009dfec0b91811015f11e94c6550d0d1283cf9b873c64660",
      "text": "拥有看透事物本质、并将其传达给众人的才能……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_f:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e591f88c96e8df66720ff720a261969a62d70300a81ddf91f6e00b0d9b7d5b65",
      "text": "哪怕是我在谈及海洋的壮丽时，\n都希望能向他多多学习呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:feedd8022c5f359d58485844d4c823e47489a33e320bad15bcd66dd86b91d735",
      "text": "他以前也曾负责过为商品制作宣传POP的工作。\n请务必给他一个发挥才能的机会！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03340c6a676abb476b629db4abfb9df6c60bef94efb25ce8063a275602c5982c",
      "text": "（……呵呵。我待过的小杂货店和老牌钟表店相比，\n卖的东西差距也太大了吧。……不过）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a75234300cc42b9d48073febd8cccdda6c8cbbccf12aaf0b0f3872cea11e5ac",
      "text": "（既然被这么信任……\n也没有主动把工作往外推的道理呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:075471d4571f0ae0a4eace98e46427cc9aad38efea6b1092c60b501e0410f823",
      "text": "我明白了。\n不嫌弃我的话，我很乐意提供协助～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37ec8f2984217312427c1aa57afb63ac80d46e723b9ec167137940b899f0209c",
      "text": "接着呢，就聊到了克里斯先生拥有的手表\n防水性能特别出众的话题……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f487318189ff9f88dc9ac337bf8728097fde06247d41ff8602619223402d79ec",
      "text": "像什么10个大气压和30个大气压防水的区别之类的，\n聊专业话题也聊得好尽兴呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3108689cf969e8878ae687464517a4281dc32a47141f294ed06750d976404a6b",
      "text": "能听到这么多珍贵的知识，\n真是度过了一段极为充实的时光……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c84cd4c0ea02d310f1b64a76af2111b9ddd3400dbadafcb8ba9084bc96258cf1",
      "text": "后来在那里的交谈，也顺利促成了新的工作。\n雨彦先生，请过目这份资料。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8eafc1c65449a985079de162f537208e79bff594a63a7879ea9dab1c9003b4d6",
      "text": "追加了新的广告……？\n嚯，用上了北村提出的建议啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a57404699f99c4df3cde4a12b82854f678d2e645c86c13acfba6681fd604991",
      "text": "是的！为了能将想乐的创意完美展现出来，\n拍摄当天我们必须加倍努力了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12aebf7f1665f55ba5c57967b5bb2c03058d9030ca3c851a52b932e2b6bac120",
      "text": "哈哈，说的也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_g:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4c4c65897e5cf57a2a784649bf75703a57e12c87ff06b8daf140bced87662d6",
      "text": "既然对方是老爹的熟人，\n我也得比平时更加打起精神才行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_h:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b444bafc68f25659e0fe320c39e2d36bb20fec3d49c513abdf3aad9b9d42394",
      "text": "广告拍摄当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_h:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74558bc916b62177252b41c73c938936cb95c3b0a1e897a36e7d50c82c290e63",
      "text": "摄影棚",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:763d3f7fa8c2a08917ceda17069a13b728965bec5c84b60faba039932bd19221",
      "text": "哎～。克里斯先生，\n打算买KIETOKI的手表啊～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_h:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72b2f36345944bba9e133781581615b7a7875f086a24637dac7e0d7a83beac19",
      "text": "是的。就是前几天被介绍的那款、\n最新的潜水表……哎呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04ec62a580296c26c5cb507f5988225f9e1078bdf63268a3b873fe4b68c53d97",
      "text": "所以说……要说多少遍你才懂啊！\n这个镜头的机位……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_h:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:254749406238c07977d930e700dbe691912c270c7f44d5cebb88ba4b5e20c22b",
      "text": "想乐先生、克里斯先生，不好意思。刚收到联络，\n拍摄的开工时间可能会稍微推迟一点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_h:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:938370eafaafec2d2b671a2a4b7706ff4bae4c19d043532c9653f4e7b9d0e4eb",
      "text": "明白了。\n我们需要继续在这里待命就可以了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_h:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fb1c9e083cffbfe39d8c17d7385059406eb28d728f16afc89217e4be5383d3a",
      "text": "是的，暂时先保持原样。似乎是因为工作人员之间\n预想的画面效果有出入，需要重新进行确认。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_h:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:364159022a8b2389a06824b7949795477f6b9b8c46976585aa91b782ce6671bd",
      "text": "嘛，到了当天实际上手才发现不对劲，\n也是常有的事呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0339cad9bdad7e17804ee30cb8aab86a341610051a5d1ed12331796a9cfe4ff1",
      "text": "虽说如此，但现场看起来火药味有点浓呢。\n要是能顺顺利利谈妥就好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_h:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a82fe5570e7e22e833be8778381e44524042fa879b097a9c222f3945ddc4efa",
      "text": "哟，辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23197d61bbe015b1e2a65435492843c17a5893021aad33534ebe23915676e3c1",
      "text": "雨彦先生，辛苦了。\n您刚才去哪里了……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:320619e9744adef386c41dd029a24d2d0a51b8ef20ef74e675b02987daaf1e6e",
      "text": "没什么，就在这附近顺手打扫了一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:600803e853ac7cf5ad2c39d679559be2ed523327fd55501be88d946756fd0095",
      "text": "当清洁工落下的职业病，一看到脏东西就忍不住。\n没打声招呼就走开，不好意思啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd324f861a142005f23e91866d6fe95063d7f568bc79af4c7313be3fa3e331f2",
      "text": "不，没关系的。\n刚才我们接到通知，说拍摄可能会稍微延误……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_i:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:299480e7786ac5039e0bf35c074ee587b4528b061cceddc52751251bb699fd92",
      "text": "搞什么啊……大家追求的方向本来不就是一样的嘛。\n不好意思啊，刚才语气有点太冲了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_i:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:905fda94cbe88c297df82bb90b1089d5fda0a3ccec1604d2e0bc0d9c288a6889",
      "text": "？现场似乎有什么转变了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:911248bb09e577e217a3febd62f02cfb151605de3f5d25d5965bb9adae473327",
      "text": "看那副样子，问题似乎已经解决了。\n回来的时机正好嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:486486528dbb22bdf591d22d06917b512c87f9363667b44ae2f2daa3130539c3",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n这样一来，拍摄也能开始了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_i:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b4b8f1a183832f36b16755bedd3fbecb477d8d09e2e765ba7e1950d4b849eb2",
      "text": "是的，工作人员已经在朝这边招手了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_i:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b67aacaa6334a49c411c0a9f1425cb70d09a20bdaf4b3c02eac159d2bd241a50",
      "text": "Legenders的各位，让大家久等了！\n马上就要开始拍摄啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:163b980631f6473635c2be9be121b33e607cca43a156ec16d77f238a59e28b80",
      "text": "广告拍摄结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e655382783f0175491001c3af063ab16cc9d20e820dfe1b1d0b836ac3446817",
      "text": "会长？您特意过来了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98143655f19129b8385ca3dcb6618a418e806a8b77891fd3e0fe161e772f91c6",
      "text": "是啊，我来观摩一下拍摄。\n话说回来……真不可思议啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12fd0a3acc1f4457df899b2b0e92d6a40bd05e123e4acb3abed1bdbb3f1fe5e9",
      "text": "这里的空气，感觉就和你父亲当年打扫完之后一样，\n流动着一股清新澄澈的气息……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:769818b4936ba9ef659d7447888b8734084828762bcaabfc402201a70eba2ac5",
      "text": "噢噢，雨彦。\n你的打扫技术受到夸赞了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db580d8bd15756f8111567ae16c8465dfa002d2976127cc06f2f45cfcd8e2316",
      "text": "岁月流转中，承袭父辈艺。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcf65a0702523831f7fc5278d0667953572f89344af2a856647c292f297dcf01",
      "text": "雨彦先生和你的父亲，\n打扫的方式很像呢～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e263e50b24c27773eafd7bdf822b704f897722f1a388c5c2e859bec51102d55a",
      "text": "……是啊。\n毕竟从小被老爹狠狠操练过嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fa65b0917c56797e0e87a0f5b1f7e9743806303b23f8200b15401747411f4b1",
      "text": "这么说来……\n果然是葛之叶君帮忙打扫的啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:141dea9d5d304014096fca70f220bfc164ac9191b83138fd48e48a81f2faf595",
      "text": "无论是作为偶像，还是作为清洁工。\n你们父子俩都给予了我们莫大的帮助，谢谢你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5384807435632290fcf361ced73c9a6438704e04a76e7bda3c6b8c4b30a2e450",
      "text": "托Legenders的福，托你的福。\n这次的宣传一定会大获成功的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bc0090c9a260b9eb62ca5e9bdf0c010a180e24efdf927b563dbd30d08986482",
      "text": "倘若我的所作所为，能够继承家父的一缕余泽……\n我个人也深感自豪。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000092:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000099:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1f08171709b54afc5af63f2faf934771f56c6af5780e9ab9041dfaad823f194",
      "text": "雨彦先生。今后，\n可不要再擅自走开\n不见人影了哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000101:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:475d40e4b15022002f1a70c6ba6dff096d0751515366de8d873e9c3c4708a013",
      "text": "你跑去打扫的期间，\n制作人\n可担心了哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000103:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a80ad82ec1f11fb2dfd4d5a5416d45156dfd9136b687f7f701ec9bdf5d3c94d",
      "text": "是我不好。\n以后我尽量，\n打声招呼再去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000105:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7ca2eceedfd0cd96a2ce632c787fcacd01cb11ebfc21ae93039fdf8d8f7ae9f",
      "text": "真的吗？\n总觉得不太靠谱呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000107:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d6da4046f10fb393868ec3a056eb465dc3ed933c869b3571d76af14cb8dd548",
      "text": "雨彦的心情，\n我也能够理解。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000109:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c101b73c4a55cc8383eaeaa559a9bfd80774326abe05185ffc2c8d4451b1adf9",
      "text": "我也是一旦在海里看到\n在意的存在，就坐立难安、\n按捺不住了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000111:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d332e84a311dfbe2b50b1ca173b96bebb136af23d24ddc6acc3c66734655780",
      "text": "你们两个都太由着性子来啦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000113:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d69338dfa39fda76c0e5e948aab2ec523e660c6aa818699931369684ffacabd",
      "text": "现场工作人员发来了\n感谢打扫的邮件哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000113:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db63df9c2c9de17a40a09f490d5555b1f6bce3a976ec65a5f94b0fff0032cb05",
      "text": "说起来工作人员也发来了\n感谢打扫的\n邮件哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000116:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66f0ece49f5b3cc73f32e16c3e7e51face70599f4cbb94c750ac4897d88cedf1",
      "text": "算了，既然得到了感激\n那也算是件好事啦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000118:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5098102df46209d506bafed02ee8055396490647b3228fa1c36f2d2e14263a0b",
      "text": "雨彦，太好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000120:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47ab8e5b32affbbfe2936571e5649bc088b3099e8500752017c7a7ddc2989dbc",
      "text": "是啊。你们几个，\n今天也辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000122:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f01d5d3bb60d233669640aef9e3b27797f531387e3289e663724304ed6bbe6e",
      "text": "以后也请多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000124:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce093744c1f891b9e77b5eb371f75030cdcd33d6fcfaa468a793402918254a52",
      "text": "好～的。\n那大家辛苦啦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_j:cmd-000126:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b931c9ac025c67398cf3de61e50e2e0962ba5bedb511847af329929b93c76496",
      "text": "是的。各位，\n辛苦了。之后也\n请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_k:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_k:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7664d57c4140c90148e06990605522019039f62818e4612211292da42cfc10b7",
      "text": "（这包裹，是会长寄来的吧。修理已经完成了吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_k:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58907581cd0e5ca3591a8d2a87740fb37e7c4ce1f27d83c6b1ed306e0b68f93b",
      "text": "嘿咻……如何，\n戴在我的手腕上，多少也能相称一些了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_k:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:519c35f5f0b17f255806a6bf58ec4321c764e855021e45f0922fcc6d41a187fd",
      "text": "（呐，老爹。你当年是在和很不错的人一起共事啊。\n虽然可能只是件琐碎小事……但能知道这些，真好）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_k:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fd2eb177d457348394a390f28cd96ec9c7f7df79cd3471b7ffff7cad0116d61",
      "text": "我现在，也正被一群很棒的家伙包围着呢。\n是一群对我这个无趣的家伙来说甚至有些过分热闹的伙伴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_k:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b29ecae0e798c23db667e226ee1893185a61800c138404cc006d5b5a8695cdf",
      "text": "……能像这样戴上它，也全多亏了那帮家伙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_k:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bb6e834ddb3a46b61aff7df3f58dc78e7a86ab0003fc971ab5f68d91f9bd2ea",
      "text": "好不容易修好了。\n从今往后，得好好爱护它才行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30010_01:1_3_30010_01_k:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:951ba5ad9001a83726e3a0f00792c1485622934f70a974fb1524dfc4e0905f88",
      "text": "（好好看着我们的工作吧，老爹）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
